            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala EJAKAIT ebe, “Kwape kwaŋin enyamenenata idwe luka Isirael inyamatakec lumam elaete, kotoma atekerin nuereneari kes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.13",
